WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.574 --> 00:00:02.336
- [Announcer] This is the true story

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:06.630
of what happens when two
trans people walk into a bar.

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:09.630
(suspenseful music)

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:19.283
- Hey.

00:00:19.283 --> 00:00:20.480
- Hey, how are you?

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.694
- Good, how 'bout you?

00:00:21.694 --> 00:00:22.527
- Good.

00:00:22.527 --> 00:00:23.777
You know, work.

00:00:24.752 --> 00:00:25.585
- Totally.

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:27.747
I'll have a beer, please.

00:00:27.747 --> 00:00:28.580
- Same.

00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:32.096
- Weird weather we're having, right?

00:00:32.096 --> 00:00:32.929
- Yeah.

00:00:33.995 --> 00:00:36.745
Kinda waiting for winter already.

00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:41.622
- Thanks.

00:00:42.558 --> 00:00:44.891
(pop music)

00:00:51.555 --> 00:00:55.777
- I actually think my
friend just walked in, so.

00:00:55.777 --> 00:00:57.766
- Cool.
- Gonna.

00:00:57.766 --> 00:01:00.294
(mumbles)
- Nice to see you.

00:01:00.294 --> 00:01:02.678
- Yeah, see you 'round.

00:01:02.678 --> 00:01:03.678
- Take care.

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.737
- [Announcer] And then they leave.

00:01:07.737 --> 00:01:09.130
(suspenseful music)

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:09.963
- Hey.

00:01:11.735 --> 00:01:13.193
Down here. (laughing)

00:01:13.193 --> 00:01:15.443
(laughing)

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:18.253
Hey!

